{"book":"amos","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T12:09:14.632302100Z","verse":8,"ref":"amos 8:8","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":8,"translation":"On account of this, will ⟨the⟩ earth not quake, and ⟨will⟩ every inhabitant in it ⟨not⟩ mourn? And it ⟨the earth⟩ will swell up like ⟨the⟩ Nile, all of it, and be tossed about and subside like ⟨the⟩ Nile of Egypt.","tokens":[{"surface":"העל","gloss":"because of"},{"surface":"זאת","gloss":"this"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תרגז","gloss":"will tremble"},{"surface":"הארץ","gloss":"⟨the⟩ earth"},{"surface":"ואבל","gloss":"and mourn"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"every"},{"surface":"יושב","gloss":"inhabitant"},{"surface":"בה","gloss":"in it"},{"surface":"ועלתה","gloss":"and it will rise up"},{"surface":"כאר","gloss":"like ⟨the⟩ Nile"},{"surface":"כלה","gloss":"all of it"},{"surface":"ונגרשה","gloss":"and be tossed about"},{"surface":"ונשקה","gloss":"and subside"},{"surface":"כיאור","gloss":"like ⟨the⟩ Nile"},{"surface":"מצרים","gloss":"of Mitsrayim"}]}